# Twenty-second bounded finite-system scout

Declared 2026-09-07, before scientific code or map execution. Author:
nineteenth_finite_scout. Scope is the existing unfinished five-seat batch.
Only this directory is writable; sealed nineteenth/twenty-first, P208/FTH,
